{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vanishing Train | \u30ef\u30f3\u30de\u30f3\u5217\u8eca is a psychological horror game where you work as a train driver on a rural Japanese railway line.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual, the protagonist begins their day driving a local train deep in the mountains. <br>However, as they carry out their duties, strange and inexplicable events slowly begin to unfold\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a train driver and complete your daily duties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D horror experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since this is a demo version, it can be completed in about 10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed solo by a 16-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and corporations are free to record, upload, and stream videos of this game without prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also fully allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, we would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that RAYBIS GAMES takes no responsibility for any damages caused by uploading or streaming game-related videos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without notice.\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3